type: software
title: "Temporal ONA builder"
abstract: "A browser tool that draws an ONA-inspired temporal ordered network from coded self-regulated learning episode logs, showing time spent, timing and sequence in one figure. It is a descriptive visualisation, not a full ordered network analysis."
